       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MOVE-OVERLAP-TEST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TABLE-VALUES.
          05 TABLE-NUM PIC 999 OCCURS 3.
       01 TABLE-IDX PIC 9 VALUE 1.
       01 TEXT-RESULT PIC XXX.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           MOVE 123 TO TABLE-NUM(1).
           MOVE 456 TO TABLE-NUM(2).
           MOVE 789 TO TABLE-NUM(3).
           MOVE TABLE-NUM(TABLE-IDX) TO TABLE-IDX TEXT-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "IDX=" TABLE-IDX " TEXT=" TEXT-RESULT.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM MOVE-OVERLAP-TEST.
